## Dialogue 2
I think my friend will have a hard time.

**Yuki:** My friend wants to buy some clothes so where do you think he should go?

**Yuna:** How about Dongdaemun Market? There are many items there and lots to see.

**Yuki:** The market is so crowded that I think my friend will have a hard time.

**Yuna:** There is also a large discount store near the Dongdaemun Market.

**Yuki:** Really? I think it will be more comfortable to shop at the discount store.

**Yuna:** That place is always on sale so there will be a lot of cheap and good things to buy.

